- the country and intended travel dates (or just the date you plan to start a 6‑month stay),

I’ll calculate whether the expiry falls within the required window and recommend next steps (renew now, apply with current passport, contact the consulate, etc.). I’ll only use non-sensitive details (no full SSN).

